  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a pan over medium heat. Fry the garlic and red onion until softened.",
    "Add the canned tuna, breaking it up with a spoon. Cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the pistachio paste, capers, sherry vinegar, salt, and black pepper. Cook for another minute.",
    "Remove the pan from the heat and let it cool slightly.",
    "Stir in the lacquer glaze and adjust seasoning if needed.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a bowl and serve immediately."
